<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">pet</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">pet</ansi> command affectionately pets another player's pet in the
room, or gives your own pet a nickname.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">pet <petname></ansi>      Pet another player's pet in the room.
  <ansi fg="command">pet name <newname></ansi> Give your own pet a nickname (once only).

Pet names follow the same rules as player names — no prohibited
patterns, no conflicts with existing characters or creature types.
A pet can only be named once.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help pets</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help companion</ansi>
